ay's heading two lines above and by the 1962; an automatic repair that would have altered one 1962 word was reverted because the 1862 supports the layer's reading. Corroboration: 1922 Mame carries 10 October at PDF p. 850; not transcribed.","relationship":"editorial-projection-exact-to-target","source_date":"2026-09-03 project editorial projection; antecedent Pustet Ratisbon 1862","source_id":"passage.triptych.roman-1962-latin-proper-editorial-projection.editorial-projection-2026-09-03.s-francisci-borgiae-confessoris-collect","status":"collated","transformations":["join printed line wraps","remove stress accents","expand printed ae/oe ligatures to ae/oe","normalise consonantal i to the calendar's j orthography","apply the target printing's punctuation","carry the target's conclusion at its printed length"],"verification_locator":"printed p. 685, no. 3843, marked P; artifact PDF p. 766","verification_source_id":"passage.catholic-church.missale-romanum.vatican-typica-1962.temporal-s-francisci-borgiae-confessoris-orations"},"publication":{"basis":"public-domain","evidence":"The wording is preexisting material of the 1962 typical edition under 17 U.S.C. 103(b), which gives a revised edition no exclusive right in material it did not contribute. The independent registered public-domain witness is the tracked 1862 Pustet text artifact. The position is settled for the repository at src/sources/inventories/missale-romanum-1962-facsimile-rights-v1.toml, which names the seasonal orations as preexisting material and requires exactly this pairing of 103(b) with a public-domain witness.","locator":"Pustet Ratisbon 1862, printed p. 558; text-layer lines 76418-76426; artifact rights_status public-domain on a book first published in 1862","source_ids":["artifact.triptych.roman-1962-latin-proper-editorial-projection.editorial-projection-2026-09-03.repair-1-orations-d8781e74","artifact.catholic-church.missale-romanum.pustet-ratisbon-1862.missale-romanum-1862-text-f34bc7cf"],"status":"